  "notes": [
    "RC13 was held on a premature capability snapshot; RC14 on an unattributed configuration-save failure. RC15 adds bounded readiness/replacement handling and safe diagnostics, then repeats every release gate.",
    "RC15 adopts Fjall 3.1.13 with engine LZ4, shared Git deltas, independent mutable keys and automatic/manual resumable redb migration; Goose unchanged.",
    "Guarded full-scale and 2.50 GiB store benchmarks passed on games; see RC13 local receipts; RC15 retains the storage code and adds native fixture readiness, safe configuration-save diagnostics and bounded replacement retries.",
    "Live Bedrock profile validation remains final stable acceptance; local fixtures do not establish live AWS account access."
